{"id":"7c98a5e0a5533d5f","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-perpetual-strategy.md","title":"保持发散的函数策略","display":"df-perpetual-strategy — 保持发散的函数策略","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-perpetual-strategy","aliases":["56-df-perpetual-strategy"],"display":"df-perpetual-strategy — 保持发散的函数策略","depends_on":["[[56-df-many-step-functional-strategy]]","[[56-df-strongly-normalizing]]"],"source_section":"§4.9 Definition 4.9.16","source_printed_pages":"135","source_ocr_blocks":[156],"source_verification":"已据本地DjVu提取文本核对对应段落；本节点的独立论证与核验边界见Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-perpetual-strategy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-perpetual-strategy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-perpetual-strategy — 保持发散的函数策略"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bb3bb78c5caf074d\" href=\"?note=bb3bb78c5caf074d\" title=\"56-df-many-step-functional-strategy\">56-df-many-step-functional-strategy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"251992a231a52348\" href=\"?note=251992a231a52348\" title=\"56-df-strongly-normalizing\">56-df-strongly-normalizing</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.9 Definition 4.9.16"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"135"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>156</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"已据本地DjVu提取文本核对对应段落；本节点的独立论证与核验边界见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\\subseteq A^2\">\\(\\to\\subseteq A^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in A^A\">\\(F\\in A^A\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FunctionalReductionStrategy}\">\\(\\mathrm{FunctionalReductionStrategy}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bb3bb78c5caf074d\" href=\"?note=bb3bb78c5caf074d\" title=\"56-df-many-step-functional-strategy\">56-df-many-step-functional-strategy</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SNAt}(A,\\to,a)\">\\(\\mathrm{SNAt}(A,\\to,a)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"251992a231a52348\" href=\"?note=251992a231a52348\" title=\"56-df-strongly-normalizing\">56-df-strongly-normalizing</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PerpetualFunctionalStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{FunctionalReductionStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\land\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\bigl(\\neg\\mathrm{SNAt}(A,\\to,a)\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{SNAt}(A,\\to,F(a))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PerpetualFunctionalStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{FunctionalReductionStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\land\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\bigl(\\neg\\mathrm{SNAt}(A,\\to,a)\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{SNAt}(A,\\to,F(a))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>非强正规化表示存在一条无限归约；保持发散要求所选目标也仍有这种可能，不要求每条后续归约都无限。原书以∞(t)表示这一性质。本谓词并不与正规化逻辑互斥：在强正规化系统上该附加条件真空成立，每个合法策略同时可以正规化。</p>\n<p>来源的OCR页块序号按本地提取文本中的分页符编号，不等同于DjVu物理页码。本轮未作机器证明；计算性未编码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-many-step-functional-strategy","status":"resolved","id":"bb3bb78c5caf074d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-many-step-functional-strategy]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-strongly-normalizing","status":"resolved","id":"251992a231a52348","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-strongly-normalizing]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-many-step-functional-strategy","status":"resolved","id":"bb3bb78c5caf074d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FunctionalReductionStrategy}$ 见 [[56-df-many-step-functional-strategy]]；$\\mathrm{SNAt}(A,\\to,a)$ 见 [[56-df-strongly-normalizing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-strongly-normalizing","status":"resolved","id":"251992a231a52348","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FunctionalReductionStrategy}$ 见 [[56-df-many-step-functional-strategy]]；$\\mathrm{SNAt}(A,\\to,a)$ 见 [[56-df-strongly-normalizing]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\to\\subseteq A^2","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in A^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FunctionalReductionStrategy}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SNAt}(A,\\to,a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PerpetualFunctionalStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{FunctionalReductionStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\land\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\bigl(\\neg\\mathrm{SNAt}(A,\\to,a)\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{SNAt}(A,\\to,F(a))\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1540,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-190","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-perpetual-strategy.md]]"}],"outgoing":["bb3bb78c5caf074d","251992a231a52348"]}